# Raw/frozen satellite exports and runtime live-data caches — never
# committed as-is. Small, app-ready derived files go in the TRACKED
# data/app/ folder instead (RESOURCES.md §4b): parquet grid, heat PNG,
# ward GeoJSON, precomputed presets, live_snapshot.json, news_snapshot.json,
# reactions_cache.json.
data/raw/
data/frozen/
data/live_cache.json
data/news_cache.json
*.tif
*.tiff

# Secrets — Streamlit Cloud secrets live in the app's Secrets settings, not here.
.env
*.key
service-account*.json
.streamlit/secrets.toml

# Reproducibility: uv.lock is committed on purpose (RESOURCES.md §4b), do not ignore it.
